[["قُلۡ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One","Qul huwa Allahu ahadun"],["ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","Allah, the Eternal Refuge","Allahu alssamadu"],["لَمۡ يَلِدۡ وَلَمۡ يُولَدۡ","He neither begets nor is born","Lam yalid walam yooladu"],["وَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدُۢ","Nor is there to Him any equivalent","Walam yakun lahu kufuwan ahadun"]]